DRAFT — NOT ADOPTED. See ./README.md before using this file.

**Product direction (2026-10-01):** free personal tool — **MIT at repository root is the
recommended adoption path**, matching `README.md:341-343`.

This file contains:

  - **OPTION C — MIT License (RECOMMENDED)** — copy to `/LICENSE` after setting copyright line
  - **OPTION A — Proprietary EULA (ARCHIVED)** — retained only if commercial scope returns
  - **OPTION B — Open-core / dual licence (NOT RECOMMENDED)**

Background (see ../06-compliance.md §1.1):
  - README claims MIT but **no root LICENSE file exists** — grant gap for users and packagers.
  - Prior commercial analysis warned against accidental MIT if selling the product; that goal
    is **withdrawn** (`docs/product/01-product-definition.md`).
  - Before adoption: confirm contributor rights if outside code was merged (Legal Question 1).

