ADOPTION CHECKLIST (FREE MIT PROJECT)
================================================================================

1. Set copyright holder name in Option C text.
2. Copy Option C to `/LICENSE`; ensure README § License matches.
3. Adopt `NOTICE.md` → `/NOTICE` and include in GitHub Release artifacts and installer.
4. Point `installer/setup.iss` `LicenseFile=` at MIT or a combined licence+NOTICE file.
5. Publish `SECURITY.md` at repository root.

If a **paid** product returns: do not assume MIT can be retracted for versions already
released under MIT; use Option A forward-only after counsel review.
